  m_Name: WrenchDialogue
  m_EditorClassIdentifier: Assembly-CSharp::DialogueData
  characterName: Ivan (Reflection)
  dialogueText: The weight of the brass wrench... it feels heavier in my hand than
    it did on my skull. Obie must have dropped it in his haste. He was always better
    with numbers than with violence. He called the police before he even ran. A strange,
    caring kind of betrayal.
